WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.702
-Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:04.437
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:05.871
And now we're going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.871 --> 00:00:07.407
President Biden on Monday

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:10.977
announced the so-called
billionaire minimum income tax

00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:12.745
as part of his 2023 budget --

00:00:12.745 --> 00:00:15.281
specifically, the part
they'll have to cut out

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:16.416
before it will pass.

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:18.184
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:22.187
President Biden yesterday signed
an anti-lynching bill into law

00:00:22.187 --> 00:00:25.592
and not, as I would have hoped,
President Buchanan.

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:27.861
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.528 --> 00:00:32.231
After meeting with
Judge Ketanji Brown Jackson

00:00:32.231 --> 00:00:33.500
yesterday for the second time,

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.902
Republican senator Susan Collins
told reporters

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:38.537
she felt Jackson had met
her personal standard

00:00:38.537 --> 00:00:39.938
for serving
on the Supreme Court,

00:00:39.938 --> 00:00:43.743
which is blowing anything
under a .08 on a breathalyzer.

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:45.244
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.244 --> 00:00:46.946
The White House said yesterday

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:49.182
that it would not invoke
executive privilege

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:50.617
to shield Jared Kushner

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:52.618
from testifying
before the House committee

00:00:52.618 --> 00:00:54.454
investigating
the Capitol attack.

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:58.191
And if indicted,
he could be tried as an adult.

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:00.159
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.159 --> 00:01:02.528
After it was reported
that former President Trump

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:04.630
may have communicated
during the Capitol attack

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:06.699
using so-called burner phones,

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:09.268
Trump released a statement
on Monday that said,

00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:12.539
"I have no idea
what a burner phone is.

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:16.910
To the best of my knowledge, I
have never even heard the term."

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.377
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.377 --> 00:01:23.382
I love the way he always goes a
little too far with his denials.

00:01:23.382 --> 00:01:24.517
It's like if someone said,

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:26.186
"Hey, man, I haven't seen
your wife lately,"

00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:29.455
and you said, "I wouldn't even
know how to poison someone."

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:31.123
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.123 --> 00:01:34.727
"And I sure as hell
don't own a shovel."

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:36.495
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.495 --> 00:01:38.831
After facing criticism
for his plan

00:01:38.831 --> 00:01:41.067
to clear homeless encampments
from the city,

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:43.969
New York mayor Eric Adams
told reporters yesterday,

00:01:43.969 --> 00:01:45.438
"I'm like broccoli.

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:47.807
You're going to hate me now,
but you're gonna love me later."

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:50.209
Well, okay, but just speaking
for myself,

00:01:50.209 --> 00:01:52.779
it's been 48 years on broccoli.

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:54.279
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.279 --> 00:01:55.881
According to a new study,

00:01:55.881 --> 00:01:58.618
eating just two servings
of avocado a week

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:01.987
can reduce the risk of having
a heart attack by more than 20%.

00:02:01.987 --> 00:02:06.092
So, yeah, still no such thing
as affordable healthcare.

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:08.060
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:11.531
Two avocados a week?

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:14.867
Who's making
two-avocados-a-week money?

00:02:14.867 --> 00:02:17.003
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:18.871
Walgreens has announced plans

00:02:18.871 --> 00:02:21.340
to open robot-powered
fulfillment centers

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:23.476
across the U.S.
to help fill prescriptions,

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:25.211
with each robotic pharmacist

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:27.947
able to complete
300 prescriptions an hour,

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:29.381
which will give you more time

00:02:29.381 --> 00:02:32.285
to wait for someone
to come unlock the razors.

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:35.355
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:38.757
[ As robot ]
Robot does not unlock razors.

00:02:38.757 --> 00:02:40.560
[ Normal voice ] Come on,
you've got robot hands.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:43.028
[ As robot ]
No, robot does not.

00:02:43.028 --> 00:02:45.865
Only fill prescriptions.

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:47.066
That is Steve's job.

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:48.067
[ Normal voice ]
Where's Steve?

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:49.535
[ As robot ]
Steve is on break.

00:02:49.535 --> 00:02:51.137
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.137 --> 00:02:52.305
No, robot --

00:02:52.305 --> 00:02:53.640
[ Laughing ]

00:02:55.174 --> 00:02:58.044
Steve never tell robot
where he is going.

00:02:58.044 --> 00:03:01.714
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:04.116
Make robot sad.

00:03:04.116 --> 00:03:06.085
Steve robot best friend.

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:07.754
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.557 --> 00:03:13.725
[ Laughs ]

00:03:13.725 --> 00:03:16.862
[ Normal voice ] According --
According to new reports,

00:03:16.862 --> 00:03:19.531
Apple is set to make
10 million fewer AirPods

00:03:19.531 --> 00:03:21.734
than anticipated this year
due to rising inflation,

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:24.804
so maybe think twice before
walking over a sewer grate.

00:03:24.804 --> 00:03:27.039
"Aww!

00:03:27.039 --> 00:03:29.775
Aw, man, my AirPod.

00:03:29.775 --> 00:03:31.110
I don't got the money for more.

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:33.212
I already bought
my two avocados."

00:03:33.212 --> 00:03:34.747
[ Laughter ]

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:36.916
And finally, in honor of Easter,

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:39.585
Disney World will offer
a so-called Boozy Bunny,

00:03:39.585 --> 00:03:41.321
which features
a chocolate rabbit

00:03:41.321 --> 00:03:42.555
filled with a bourbon drink.

00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:44.056
It's the perfect treat
for people

00:03:44.056 --> 00:03:45.691
who shouldn't be
at Disney World.

00:03:45.691 --> 00:03:46.792
[ Laughter,
cheers and applause ]

00:03:46.792 --> 00:03:48.928
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

